guide hearthbound/s16
title Lv 40: mount, dual spec + Scarlet Monastery
faction Alliance
levels 40-40
zone map 1426
author Brownie
keywords Hearthbound, Dun Morogh · Ironforge · Stormwind · Hillsbrad · Tirisfal
next hearthbound/s17

step In Ironforge
  zone map 1455
  tip Greater Heal! It replaces Heal on Shift+E for your Holy spec. · Unlocks at 40. · Make spec 2 Holy for dungeons, and keep Shadow for questing. · You're in Ironforge anyway!
  task "Train Lv 40" optional
  task "Dual spec" optional
  task "Archmage Antonidas: The Unabridged Autobiography" optional

step Ironforge hand-ins you carried here
  zone map 1455
  turnin 514 "Letter to Stormpike" @74.6,11.7 -- Ironforge · Hall of Explorers · Prospector Stormpike (74.6, 11.7)
  turnin 637 "Sully Balloo's Letter" @63.5,67.3 -- Ironforge · Sara Balloo (63.5, 67.3)

step Get your mount
  zone map 1426
  tip 100g for Apprentice Riding (includes your first ram). · Extra colors are 20g each from Veron Amberstill. 10% off at Honored with Ironforge. · Drag the ram onto V (it's been waiting empty). · Your Holy spec has its own bars. · Set them up in naowh for spec 2, then import.
  task "Riding + your first ram" optional
  task "Bind your mount" optional
  task "Re-import naowh" optional

step Tram to Stormwind
  zone map 1453
  tip Tram over from Ironforge. · With the books from Desolace, Stonetalon, Alterac, Arathi and Ironforge you should be at 20 = Greater Friend of the Library (ring: Field Researcher's Loop or Philanthropist's Ring).
  turnin 697 "Malin's Request" @50.5,87.5 -- Stormwind · Archmage Malin, Mage Quarter (50.5, 87.5)
  task "Turn in library books" optional

step Grab for later, while you're in the cities
  zone map 1453
  accept 707 "Ironband Wants You!" map 1455 @74.6,11.7
  accept 2398 "The Lost Dwarves" map 1455 @74.6,11.7
  accept 1360 "Reclaimed Treasures" map 1455 @74.2,9.4
  accept 1260 "Morgan Stern" @51.8,93.6
  accept 1448 "In Search of The Temple" @69.5,40.4

step The Lost Dwarves
  zone map 1455
  tip Baelog and the Lost Dwarves are camped at Dig Two, early in the Uldaman instance. · Just talk to Baelog to finish this and get The Hidden Chamber. · ~315 XP.
  turnin 2398 "The Lost Dwarves"

step Reclaimed Treasures
  zone map 1455
  tip Krom Stoutarm's Chest is in the North Common Hall of Uldaman. · That's the outer cave, before the instance portal, so no group is needed. · Open it for Krom Stoutarm's Treasure and bring it back to Krom in Ironforge. · ~3,600 XP.
  complete 1360 "Reclaimed Treasures" map 1418 @35.6,23.5
  turnin 1360 "Reclaimed Treasures" @74.2,9.4

step In Search of The Temple
  zone map 1453
  tip Brohann Caskbelly in Stormwind wants you to search for the Temple of Atal'Hakkar. · Read the tablets at the Sunken Temple in the Swamp of Sorrows… or just hand it in after Hinterlands. · It opens To The Hinterlands. ~3,600 XP.
  complete 1448 "In Search of The Temple"
  turnin 1448 "In Search of The Temple" @69.5,40.4

step Scarlet Monastery: first long ride on your new mount
  zone map 1455
  tip Wings: Graveyard (26-36), Library (29-39), Armory (32-42), Cathedral (35-45). · For In the Name of the Light you need 4 kills across 3 wings: Houndmaster Loksey (Library, the first boss with the dogs), Herod (end of Armory), then Scarlet Commander Mograine and High Inquisitor Whitemane (end of Cathedral; Whitemane comes in when Mograine dies).
  accept 1053 "In the Name of the Light" npc 3980 "Raleigh the Devout" map 1424 @51.5,58.4 -- you should already have this one
  turnin 1053 "In the Name of the Light" map 1424 @51.5,58.4 -- Hillsbrad · Southshore · Raleigh the Devout (51.5, 58.4)
  turnin 1050 "Mythology of the Titans" @75.0,12.5 -- Ironforge · Hall of Explorers · Librarian Mae Paledust (75.0, 12.5)
  task "Scarlet Monastery (all wings)" optional
  accept 1951 "Rituals of Power" npc 6548 "Magus Tirth" map 1441 @78.3,75.7

step Rituals of Power
  zone map 1420
  tip The book is at the north end of the hallway leading to Arcanist Doan, on the left from the entrance (Scarlet Monastery Library wing). · Only mages on the quest can see it. · Hand it to Tabetha in Dustwallow next stop.
  complete 1951 "Rituals of Power"
  turnin 1951 "Rituals of Power" npc 6546 "Tabetha" map 1441 @67.3,2.2

step 🛡️ BiS gear pickups
  zone map 1453
  accept 3636 "Bring the Light" @50.3,45.5 -- hold it

